# MyButtons API

This site exposes static JSON resources for button discovery.

## Endpoints

- `GET /json/data.json` - Sound button catalog
- `GET /api/status` - Health and readiness signal
- `GET /api/openapi.json` - OpenAPI description

## Discovery

- `/.well-known/api-catalog`
- `/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource`
- `/.well-known/openid-configuration`

